# ST19 (Galactus focus, part 2): ST18 recipe + defensive state setters (57dd650).
# Diagnostic (diag_gal): 36% of goals conceded to Galactus were aerial, 29% came
# right after being demoed. ST19 keeps ST18's pruned league (Galactus ~20% of
# iterations) and adds aerial_defense 0.15 + demo_threat 0.05 starts; normal play
# (kickoff/random/random/replay) scaled x0.8 -> 0.36/0.12/0.12/0.20
# (experiments/train_st19.toml, via TRAIN_TMPL). Binary indococo-train-gal2
# (57dd650: mega2 Megabyte fix d998340 + new setters). Chains from ST18's
# selected final; measured vs the BEST in force at ST18 finals. flip_reset 70.
GAMMA=0.998; TPI=300_000; MB=100_000; LR=5e-5; ENT=0.016; OPPCH=0.60; HOLDREL=600000000; DECAY=400_000_000; MINLR=0.4
B0=/home/ubuntu/ippo_runs/code_fr9/bin/indococo-train-gal2; GAL_WEIGHT=4.5; MEGA_WEIGHT=2.0
TRAIN_TMPL=train_st19.toml
R_=/home/ubuntu/ippo_runs
EXTRA_OPPS="ST13_final:$R_/exp_ST13/checkpoints/1794063148:1.0 ST14_final:$R_/exp_ST14/checkpoints/1794079621:1.0 ST15_final:$R_/exp_ST15/checkpoints/1794111431:1.0 ST16_final:$R_/exp_ST16/checkpoints/1794133863:1.0"
EXTRA_OPPS="$EXTRA_OPPS HUNT_final:/home/ubuntu/ippo_runs/exp_HUNT/checkpoints/1794067059:1.0"
